<view class="page"><view class="intro"><text class="green">日常脊椎养护</text><view class="intro-title">小调整，积累更舒适的身体状态</view></view><view class="tabs"><view wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="*this" class="tab {{active===index?'active':''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="tab">{{item}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="symbol">{{tabs[active]}}</view><view class="title">{{content[active].title}}</view><text class="lead">{{content[active].lead}}</text><view wx:for="{{content[active].items}}" wx:key="index" class="point"><text class="check">✓</text><text>{{item}}</text></view><view class="note"><text class="note-title">记得</text><text>{{content[active].note}}</text></view></view><view class="boundary"><text class="boundary-title">科学认识自测边界</text><text>本工具为非医疗器械，仅用于健康科普与风险自测。外观和感觉只能提供有限线索，不能判断脊柱侧弯或其他疾病，也不能用于治疗或疾病监测。</text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="start">开始健康自测</button></view>